Markdown
# Munisible Task Force & Family First Rewards Platform

Open-source framework for Munisible Task Force & Family First programs. Uses gaming codes & smart contracts to unlock LUCR tokens upon achieving self-mastery missions and preserving family life. Features automated code validation, token minting/unlocks, and community governance rewards.

---

## 🌟 Mission Statement

The **Munisible Task Force** and **Family First** initiatives empower individuals and communities to build lasting resilience. By gamifying real-world achievements—ranging from personal self-mastery goals to active family support and civic duty—participants earn **LUCR tokens** that serve as proof of impact and unlock ecosystem benefits.

---

## 🛠 Features

* **Gaming Code Redemption:** Convert off-chain mission codes into on-chain LUCR tokens.
* **Category Tracking:** Organize rewards into *Self-Mastery*, *Family Preservation*, and *Task Force* achievements.
* **Open & Verifiable:** Built on transparent, audited OpenZeppelin smart contract standards.

---

## 🚀 Quick Start

### Prerequisites
* [Node.js](https://nodejs.org/) (v18+)
* [Hardhat](https://hardhat.org/) or [Foundry](https://getfoundry.sh/)

### Installation

```bash
git clone [https://github.com/your-org/munisible-family-first-lucr.git](https://github.com/your-org/munisible-family-first-lucr.git)
cd munisible-family-first-lucr
npm install
Running Tests
Bash
npx hardhat test
Deploying Locally
Bash
npx hardhat run scripts/deploy.js --network localhost
